  "forward_eligibility_constraint": "CANN 8.5.1 BF16 GroupedMatmul must be one of the exact W2 K2880/N2880 programs above and emit a 64x256 B descriptor with the physical 2880-element row stride. The source binds B before its blockDimM-dependent L2 cache hint and passes that same descriptor to SetTensorB; therefore the service applies only to descriptor requests independently classified as DRAM misses by the source-order LRU, never to L2 hits."
